  "name": {
   "zh": "HDRI · DiffusionLight",
   "en": "HDRI · DiffusionLight"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "DiffusionLight 把光照估计改写成「在画面里补画一颗镜面铬球」的问题，从一张低动态范围（LDR）画面估计光照。这张卡交付环境 HDRI（经纬图，EXR 的 rgba）；填已知 焦距 按透视展开铬球，结果不理想就换随机种子。",
   "en": "DiffusionLight recasts light estimation as painting a chrome ball into the image, estimating lighting from a single low dynamic range (LDR) image. This card delivers an environment HDRI (lat-long, the EXR's rgba); enter the known focal length to unwrap the chrome ball in perspective, and change the seed if the result is poor."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "env_light",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
